      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8551/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fold the chicken breasts to enclose filling. Wrap each with a piece of bacon; secure with a toothpick. Place in a shallow baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/qPm76NEP-j-MkZt3ug8gsWhAPGA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8551-Spinach-Stuffed-Chicken-Breasts-ddmfs-step-6-137-1f247b4db9e04443b5306505be9a0944.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8551/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake, covered, in the preheated oven until chicken is no longer pink in the center and the juices run clear, 30 to 40 minutes. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the center of each breast should read at least 165 degrees F (74 degrees C).",
